WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:06.600
I'm going to be talking a lot more about this
in the next few weeks, but I want to sort

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.320
of get us thinking about this.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:15.830
We are now past the point of no return with
Corona virus in terms of the timing of the

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.830
election.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.840
Let me explain what I mean by that.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.600
It takes somewhere in the range of eight to
10 weeks to flatten the case curve.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.380
If you lock down today.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.380
Right.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:32.050
Which means that if Florida, Arizona, these
states that are imploding, if they did a full

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:37.030
lockdown today, you would probably not see
the effect of that.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.609
You wouldn't see the cases come under control
and talk tober first.

00:00:40.609 --> 00:00:44.510
But in addition to that, deaths lagged by
20 days.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:50.659
So if we saw a lockdown today, you wouldn't
really see some of these states get the outbreak

00:00:50.659 --> 00:00:53.550
under control until late October.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.550
OK.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:01:00.889
So when you know that when you see 15000 cases
a day in Florida and death records in Florida,

00:01:00.889 --> 00:01:03.890
the timeline of how the virus works, we saw
it in New York.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:05.640
We know how long it takes.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:10.260
It means that there will be a huge corona
virus problem in some of these key states,

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:13.500
including Florida, which will be so important
for the November election.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.030
It's going to be going on in mid-October in
the best case scenario.

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:20.260
And that's if states locked down, they don't
even seem interested in locking down.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:26.730
What that tells us is Trump can't rely on
winning in November because the virus is under

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:27.730
control.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.680
Just mathematically, it's not going to happen.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.830
This means they only have dirty tricks left.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:37.020
And Andy Croll wrote a really good article
in Rolling Stone outlining the techniques

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:40.420
that Republicans and Trump are going to use
to try to win.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:44.020
One technique is going to be using lawsuits
to wreak havoc in February.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:48.370
The Trump campaign, as Andy Crow writes, and
the Republican National Committee announced

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:53.920
they were going to spend 10 million dollars
filing voted voting related lawsuits in 2020

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.530
in Pennsylvania, for example.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:02:00.420
They sued the state government of Pennsylvania
and election boards in every county to ban

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:05.260
the use of secure drop boxes for submitting
Take-Home ballots.

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:11.459
And they said that pollwatchers can only serve
in the county where they live, which is a

00:02:11.459 --> 00:02:16.129
great way to if you have a county without
a highly engaged population, you would want

00:02:16.129 --> 00:02:19.740
to bring in poll watchers from other counties
that won't be allowed.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:23.189
It's a great way to allow intimidation at
the ballot box.

00:02:23.189 --> 00:02:27.299
They're going to be working to block ballots,
including ballots submitted by mail.

00:02:27.299 --> 00:02:29.579
They're going to be working on intimidating
voters.

00:02:29.579 --> 00:02:31.620
They will be spreading disinformation.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:35.249
They're going to be working to prevent absentee
ballot expansions altogether.

00:02:35.249 --> 00:02:38.400
And we've seen Donald Trump doing that for
months already.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:44.109
They're going to use bogus fears of voter
fraud to justify whatever they can get away

00:02:44.109 --> 00:02:45.109
with.

00:02:45.109 --> 00:02:47.300
So none of these techniques are new.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.950
But the point is they don't have any more.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:54.549
The idea of, hey, you know what our strategy
will be?

00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:57.719
We'll do a little voter suppression because
we always do it.

00:02:57.719 --> 00:03:02.480
But we'll also make a case that we have dealt
with the virus and we fixed the economy.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:06.209
Trump sort of still continues to claim that
he's dealing with the virus well.

00:03:06.209 --> 00:03:09.250
But the math of it shows a different reality.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:14.450
And the cases are going to be raging for eight
to 10 weeks in the best case scenario in some

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:15.670
of these states.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.980
So all they have left are the dirty tricks.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:21.209
I'm going to be doing much more extensive
coverage of this.

00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:26.099
And my goal is we all need to be prepared
for what they are likely to do.

00:03:26.099 --> 00:03:29.140
We need to expect what they are going to do.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.930
We need to have a plan to fight it.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:34.540
We are going to be talking about how you can
get involved as an election monitor.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.530
I mean, there are things depending on state
laws that you can actually do and get involved

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:39.530
in.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:43.620
But this has to be our focus now because they're
out of actual policy arguments.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.400
Trump hasn't even talked about policy in any
way for weeks other than saying we're going

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.510
to do more of the great stuff in the second
term that I did in the first term, even though

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.620
it didn't really happen in the first term.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:56.230
And in any case, it's the fault of the Corona
virus or Democrats or Obama or who?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.230
Jimmy Carter.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:58.810
I mean, he'll blame anybody, right?

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:00.319
All they have left their dirty tricks.

00:04:00.319 --> 00:04:02.319
And that's why this is so important.

00:04:02.319 --> 00:04:05.549
Make sure you're following me on Twitter at
David Pakman.

00:04:05.549 --> 00:04:07.629
For the latest updates on all of this.

00:04:07.629 --> 00:04:09.760
We're going to take a quick break.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.019
And it's just a beautiful Friday show for
you today.

